{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"234343ad-1d48-4db9-99a8-3d538f06803b","status":"SUCCESS","response":"Implemented analytics events on registration and offers screens per **docs/EVENTS.md** using the existing `Analytics` wrapper.\n\nKey changes:\n- Added imports for `Analytics` in both screens.\n- Added boolean flags `_emailStarted` \u0026 `_phoneStarted` to ensure “started” events fire only once.\n- Captured events: `registration_email_started`, `registration_phone_started`, `loan_amount_changed`, `terms_accepted`, `registration_continue_tapped`.\n- Converted `OfferScreen` to a stateful widget with a `ScrollController` to capture `offers_scrolled` events.\n\nAll modifications are within the current workspace and no external actions were taken. The summary of work is documented in **ANSWER.md**.\n","duration_seconds":196.224977,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":37526,"output_tokens":16320,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":682688,"total_tokens":53846}}}
